A '''Troodon''' is a {{Rare}} [[Critter]] that can be found in the {{Aqua|Icy}} biome of the {{Zone|Critter Safari}}.

== Spawning ==
A '''Troodon''' can be spawned by breaking the ice walls at {{Coordinates|-104|81|-95}}, {{Coordinates|-109|90|-27}}, and {{Coordinates|-131|79|-62}} with an {{Item|Icebreaker}}. These coordinates are found within the {{Aqua|Icy}} biome of the {{Zone|Critter Safari}}.

== Behavior ==
'''Troodons''' slowly move around like a {{MobSprite|Silverfish}}. If a {{Item|Critter Capsule}} is thrown at a '''Troodon''' and is caught, it dies and drops its loot.

Attempting to free a '''Troodon''' without an {{Item|Icebreaker}} yields the following dialogue:
{{Dialogue|&8&oThere's a ︎ Critter trapped in the ice. Perhaps there's a way to break it out?}}

